🟠 postgres in inventory (prod-eu-1) keeps crashing because volume claim pgdata is out of space. It fails with "PANIC:  could not write to file "pg_wal/xlogtemp.31": No space left on device". Its last run lasted ten seconds; two restarts since its pod was created one hour ago. Fix: raise the storage request of persistentvolumeclaim/pgdata above 20Gi. To check the size and capacity of the full volume claim, run kubectl describe pvc pgdata -n inventory
